{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294130/extras/748564362797c60281bf419995e52fac.avif?t=1760339596\" width=1045 height=277 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Climb. Fall. Rise again.</strong><br><br>In <i>Death Trap Mountain</i>, every jump counts. Set in the mysterious world of <strong>Holomundran</strong>, you play as <strong>Mitch</strong>, an ordinary adventurer on an impossible mission\u2014to rescue his blue-furred dog, <strong>Gil</strong>, from the clutches of <strong>Xelthorak</strong>, an ancient dragon who believes devouring Gil\u2019s experimental energy will grant him limitless power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To reach the dragon\u2019s lair, you must ascend <strong>Death Trap Mountain</strong>\u2014a brutal vertical labyrinth filled with collapsing ledges, spinning blades, and gravity-defying puzzles. Every mistake sends you tumbling back down, but every climb teaches you something new.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294130/extras/cbaee77bed915369e59de9cd5e49aa55.webp?t=1760339596\" width=13 height=14 /></span>\u00a0\u00a0<strong>Precision Platforming:</strong> Tight, responsive controls built for skill-based gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294130/extras/cbaee77bed915369e59de9cd5e49aa55.webp?t=1760339596\" width=13 height=14 /></span>\u00a0\u00a0<strong>Evolving Challenges:</strong> Dynamic traps, puzzles, enemies and bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294130/extras/cbaee77bed915369e59de9cd5e49aa55.webp?t=1760339596\" width=13 height=14 /></span>\u00a0\u00a0<strong>A Heartfelt Quest:</strong> Save Gil, your one true companion, from Xelthorak\u2019s hunger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294130/extras/cbaee77bed915369e59de9cd5e49aa55.webp?t=1760339596\" width=13 height=14 /></span>\u00a0\u00a0<strong>Atmospheric World:</strong> Handcrafted levels and that make gameplay unforgettable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294130/extras/cbaee77bed915369e59de9cd5e49aa55.webp?t=1760339596\" width=13 height=14 /></span>\u00a0\u00a0<strong>Easy to learn, hard to master</strong>: Perfect for fans of <i>Jump King</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you conquer <strong>Death Trap Mountain</strong> and rescue <strong>Gil</strong> before <strong>Xelthorak</strong> unleashes his fury on Holomundran?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3294130?t=1760339596","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3294130?t=1760339596","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294130/8ec2ef575780a5db24c0f23522e794d035d00ef6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760339596","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294130/8ec2ef575780a5db24c0f23522e794d035d00ef6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760339596","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"